\newlabel{fig:mm-detection}{{9.1}{42}{Market maker detection analysis. The left panel shows quote update frequency distribution, with a pronounced spike at sub-second intervals indicating automated market making. The middle panel shows bid-ask quote correlation, demonstrating the symmetric updating pattern typical of market makers. The right panel shows quote refresh timing after trades, revealing the characteristic rapid response of professional liquidity providers}{figure.caption.30}{}}
